# on any call the test did not provide) is used in 36 files over 18 port types: 2 external ports (FxRateSource,
# CatalogFeedSource) and 16 neighbour ports <Module>For<Module>. No unit under test is faked. Integration tests compose
# the real Pg*Repository adapters (wiring(db)); only pure unit tests, such as job-runner.test.ts, run a service over
# in-memory ports.

